% professional advice. Its authors accept no liability for any loss or damage
% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move move with *an index*, *a second index*, *a third index* and *a thing* is made; known as move.

the fluents are:
    *an index* cell *a second index* with *a role*; known as cell.
    *a role* is a control; known as control.
    blackcell; known as blackcell.
    blackwin; known as blackwin.
    the move move with *an index*, *a second index*, *a third index* and *a thing* is legal; known as legal_move.
    whitecell; known as whitecell.
    whitewin; known as whitewin.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    the succ of *a thing* is *a second thing*.

the knowledge base breakthrough includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/breakthrough.hrf".

the succ of 1 is 2.

the succ of 2 is 3.

the succ of 3 is 4.

the succ of 4 is 5.

the succ of 5 is 6.

the succ of 6 is 7.

the succ of 7 is 8.

the move move with an index, a second index, the index and a thing is legal at a time if
    white is a control at the time
    and the index cell the second index with white at the time
    and the succ of the second index is the thing
    and it is not the case that the index cell the thing with white at the time
    and it is not the case that the index cell the thing with black at the time.

the move move with an index, a second index, a third index and a thing is legal at a time if
    white is a control at the time
    and the index cell the second index with white at the time
    and the succ of the second index is the thing
    and the succ of the index is the third index
    and it is not the case that the third index cell the thing with white at the time.

the move move with an index, a second index, a third index and a thing is legal at a time if
    white is a control at the time
    and the index cell the second index with white at the time
    and the succ of the second index is the thing
    and the succ of the third index is the index
    and it is not the case that the third index cell the thing with white at the time.

the move move with an index, a second index, the index and a thing is legal at a time if
    black is a control at the time
    and the index cell the second index with black at the time
    and the succ of the thing is the second index
    and it is not the case that the index cell the thing with white at the time
    and it is not the case that the index cell the thing with black at the time.

the move move with an index, a second index, a third index and a thing is legal at a time if
    black is a control at the time
    and the index cell the second index with black at the time
    and the succ of the thing is the second index
    and the succ of the index is the third index
    and it is not the case that the third index cell the thing with black at the time.

the move move with an index, a second index, a third index and a thing is legal at a time if
    black is a control at the time
    and the index cell the second index with black at the time
    and the succ of the thing is the second index
    and the succ of the third index is the index
    and it is not the case that the third index cell the thing with black at the time.

the goal of white is 100 at a time if
    whitewin at the time.

the goal of white is 0 at a time if
    it is not the case that whitewin at the time.

the goal of black is 100 at a time if
    blackwin at the time.

the goal of black is 0 at a time if
    it is not the case that blackwin at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    whitewin at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    blackwin at the time.

whitewin at a time if
    an index cell 8 with white at the time.

whitewin at a time if
    it is not the case that blackcell at the time.

blackwin at a time if
    an index cell 1 with black at the time.

blackwin at a time if
    it is not the case that whitecell at the time.

whitecell at a time if
    an index cell a second index with white at the time.

blackcell at a time if
    an index cell a second index with black at the time.

when the move move with an index, a second index, a third index and a thing is made
    and a role is a control
then the third index cell the thing with the role
    and it is not the case that the index cell the second index with the role.

when the move move with an index, a second index, a third index and a thing is made
    and the third index cell the thing with a role
then it is not the case that the third index cell the thing with the role.

when the move move with an index, a second index, a third index and a thing is made
    and white is a control
then black is a control
    and it is not the case that white is a control.

when the move move with an index, a second index, a third index and a thing is made
    and black is a control
then white is a control
    and it is not the case that black is a control.

it must not be true that
    the move move with an index, a second index, a third index and a thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move move with the index, the second index, the third index and the thing is legal.

